TEXT -2440 1376 Left 2 !.tran 0 20m 5m 20n\n.options plotwinsize=0\n* === DC power (the spec metric) ===\n.meas TRAN i_l3_avg AVG I(L3)\n.meas TRAN p_dc AVG 6*I(L3)\n* === Power breakdown for diagnosis ===\n.meas TRAN p_total_rail AVG V(rail)*I(L3)\n.meas TRAN p_rfbuf AVG V(rail)*I(R6)\n.meas TRAN p_classd AVG V(rail)*Ie(Q1)\n.meas TRAN p_load AVG V(vout)*I(R1)\n* === Load power (RMS-based, more accurate for RF) ===\n.meas TRAN vout_rms RMS V(vout)\n.meas TRAN p_load_rms PARAM vout_rms*vout_rms/500\n* === Rail behavior / modulation depth ===\n.meas TRAN v_rail_max MAX V(rail)\n.meas TRAN v_rail_min MIN V(rail)\n.meas TRAN v_rail_avg AVG V(rail)\n* === Switching node saturation check ===\n.meas TRAN v_sw_max MAX V(switchingnode)\n.meas TRAN v_sw_min MIN V(switchingnode)\n* === Efficiency (computed from above) ===\n.meas TRAN efficiency PARAM p_load_rms/abs(p_dc)*100\n.meas TRAN v_gap_peak PARAM v_rail_max-v_sw_max
